The Protocol MUST follow a structured release cadence to prevent drift accumulation:

| Cadence | Action |
|---|---|
| **Daily** | `mcp_watchdog.sh` auto-sync (passive) |
| **Per session** | `dv test-manifest:show` + `dv version-scan` |
| **Per PR** | 11-gate pre-commit hook enforcement |
| **Weekly** | `dv sync-all` full fleet sweep |
| **Monthly** | `dv sovereign-scan [project]` deep audit per project |
| **Per version bump** | Full `§6 Version Bump Procedure` |
| **Per new project** | `dv fix-drift` during onboarding |

**Non-negotiable**: The `mcp_watchdog.sh` cron MUST be active. Verify with: `crontab -l | grep mcp_watchdog`

