## § 12. DRIFT DETECTION MATRIX (Quick Reference)

| Symptom | Root Cause | Cure |
|---|---|---|
| `.cursorrules` shows wrong version | `dv rules` not run after bump | `dv rules` |
| Pre-commit hook missing | New repo not onboarded | `dv fix-drift` |
| `dv` binary outdated | Machine not synced | `cp scripts/dv ~/Developer/dv` |
| Test count below floor | Tests deleted without floor update | `npm run test:unit -- --run` then investigate |
| `TEST_MANIFEST.json` missing | New project not initialized | `dv test-manifest:update` |
| Poison strings in `.mdc` files | `auto_fix_rules.js` not run | `node scripts/auto_fix_rules.js` |
| Fleet has stale version strings | Version bump without `nuke-versions` | `dv nuke-versions` |
| `MISSION_STATE.md` missing | New project / model swap | Create immediately per `§3` template |
